{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1000_p", "source_sha256": "552e576a8f7a81c523078f9b3d9bedfa817a2484be9fe1a7d9298d0822ff9490", "ja": "（『不思議の国のアリス』がモチーフの舞台で、\n白ウサギを演じる瑞希。台本を読んでいたが……）", "zh": "（在以《爱丽丝梦游仙境》为主题的舞台剧中，瑞希饰演白兔。她正在读剧本，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "572801519d1d65204c445386931721d37b6ae2b3f4e3cdeb6e33cf8d9ea00053", "ja": "ふぅ……やっぱり、いい物語ですね。\n何度読んでも、ワクワクしてしまいます。", "zh": "呼……果然是个很棒的故事呢。\n无论读多少遍，还是会让人心潮澎湃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "9f62d18fa11038c0b7a6b8133bd8925da44d36cdb2febf31ccc4fe9f3350ec25", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます。\n素敵な作品に出演できるなんて……感激だぞ。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢您。\n竟然能出演这么棒的作品……真是太感动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6855dacbd75bfa2bcf1a20a8613ae50b44e333bc2f88d59d1a741b9eca271445", "ja": "いや、それだけ瑞希の頑張りが認められたってことだ。\nしかし、いいのか？　白ウサギは主役じゃないが……。", "zh": "不，这正说明瑞希的努力得到了认可。\n不过，真的没关系吗？白兔虽然不是主角……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "69d3f4f14f6ac267c173267d47e9447f2780ffba8ca51c95849d5df503b1e93d", "ja": "確かに、主人公のアリスは愛らしくて、\n私も大好きです。……ですが。", "zh": "确实，主人公爱丽丝很可爱，\n我也非常喜欢。……不过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "fe3e64baabad8fbee067d00113f76b38318c3f76b30f81d1cabbfef0257a9454", "ja": "白ウサギも、アリスと同じくらい魅力的なキャラクター\nだと思います。今から撮影が待ちきれません。", "zh": "我觉得白兔也是和爱丽丝一样有魅力的角色。已经迫不及待想开始拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1b6abb716a419900bb8504df5484d3624b13d3fdbefd24222dad4f283774aceb", "ja": "それならよかったよ。白ウサギも、物語に\n欠かせない大事なキャラクターだもんな。", "zh": "那就好。白兔也是故事中不可或缺的重要角色嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "7761ef13850443ea2a3a9c134551e3b8bd305183f932975af1db4d9e851f11b3", "ja": "はい。……それに、改めて思いました。白ウサギって、\n何となく{$P$}みたいだなって。", "zh": "是的。……而且，我又重新想了想。白兔总觉得，和{$P$}很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0ebbbff9742f7efa31b1f351d8e199ec7259cef855f787dd742d85bf6e0004c9", "ja": "えっ？　……その心は？", "zh": "咦？……为什么这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "c4264ab5e238e5924cc4aea6f419d917ef64b0008eba7fc74e800cda553ded78", "ja": "普通の少女だったアリスを誘い、新しい世界……\n不思議がいっぱいの国に導いていく。", "zh": "引领那个原本普通的少女爱丽丝，走向一个新的世界……\n一个充满奇妙的国度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "dec423b2ceb60731a0e2d9efe4eaa843a2e92772f876110ba6659e45412c400a", "ja": "私も、誘われましたから。\nアイドルという、この不思議な世界へ……。", "zh": "我也是被邀请来的。\n来到这个名为偶像的神奇世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1011_p", "source_sha256": "79a243c33c325f7cc2f621d142d5b2e62a193552885d0d1952111ea044a86f4e", "ja": "なるほど。そう言われると確かに……。", "zh": "原来如此。你这么一说，确实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "bd3caa394ee872ce6ec82e506b7849d8a1c9d1425ad33a4a72d832349bae488b", "ja": "ええ。ですから、アリスの気持ちはよくわかります。\n白ウサギに付いていく時のドキドキやワクワク……。", "zh": "嗯。所以，我很能理解爱丽丝的心情。\n跟着白兔子时那种忐忑和兴奋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "5bb7d5af4f7766ba75177867ba1033e6423472b189808dc3a5d61fbe2cf1761c", "ja": "では逆に、白ウサギはどう感じていたのか？\nその謎は、きっと演じてみなければ解けません。", "zh": "那么反过来，白兔又是怎样的感受呢？\n这个谜团，肯定只有亲自演出来才能解开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1014_p", "source_sha256": "968c26683f8885bddba95ab38e334ea4b5f4f0d1a334f314ad812779b098b441", "ja": "だから、待ち切れないと……。", "zh": "所以，才说等不及了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "e424856df9f240840b315b46017cc2dbaa2edd57638c56320dd9787154ce0f9c", "ja": "そういうことです。それに、私にとっての白ウサギ……\n{$P$}が……。", "zh": "就是这样。而且，对我而言的白兔……{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0653_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "2341fc4c453c22ff8852d224bba60f01e6c15ba26344c3e970ccf906215f06d5", "ja": "どんな気持ちで、この素敵な世界に誘ってくれたのか\n感じられるのも、また楽しみです。……ワクワク。", "zh": "我也很期待，能感受到您怀着怎样的心情邀请我来到这个美好的世界……好期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
